An alert for the rule rule-1 in the uploaded SARIF file contained 10001 thread flow locations which is more than our limit of 10000. The upload was rejected.

This needs to be fixed by the tool that produces the analysis.

[Learn more about limits in SARIF uploads](https://docs.github.com/en/code-security/code-scanning/integrating-with-code-scanning/sarif-support-for-code-scanning#validating-your-sarif-file).
